[{"componentKey":"household-food-spending-staple-trend","componentType":"line-chart","title":"米・食パン・他のパンの支出額の推移","description":null,"componentProps":{"seriesRefs":[{"metricKey":"rice-consumption-expenditure","label":"米の支出額","colorRole":"series-1"},{"metricKey":"white-bread-consumption-expenditure","label":"食パンの支出額","colorRole":"series-2"},{"metricKey":"other-bread-consumption-expenditure","label":"他のパンの支出額","colorRole":"series-3"}],"annotation":"県庁所在市の二人以上世帯の年間支出額です。県全体の値ではありません。","rankingLinks":[{"label":"食パンの支出額の定義・ランキング","url":"/ranking/white-bread-consumption-expenditure"},{"label":"他のパンの支出額の定義・ランキング","url":"/ranking/other-bread-consumption-expenditure"}]},"sourceName":"総務省 家計調査","sourceLink":"https://www.stat.go.jp/data/kakei/","rankingLink":"/ranking/rice-consumption-expenditure","gridColumnSpan":12,"gridColumnSpanTablet":null,"gridColumnSpanSm":null,"dataSource":"ranking","section":"grains","sortOrder":10},{"componentKey":"household-food-spending-alcohol-trend","componentType":"line-chart","title":"酒類の支出額の推移","description":null,"componentProps":{"seriesRefs":[{"metricKey":"beer-consumption-expenditure","label":"ビールの支出額","colorRole":"series-1"},{"metricKey":"happoshu-consumption-expenditure","label":"発泡酒・ビール風アルコール飲料の支出額","colorRole":"series-2"},{"metricKey":"sake-consumption-expenditure","label":"清酒の支出額","colorRole":"series-3"},{"metricKey":"wine-consumption-expenditure","label":"ワインの支出額","colorRole":"series-4"},{"metricKey":"shochu-consumption-expenditure","label":"焼酎の支出額","colorRole":"series-5"}],"annotation":"県庁所在市の二人以上世帯の年間支出額です。県全体の値ではありません。","rankingLinks":[{"label":"発泡酒・ビール風アルコール飲料の支出額の定義・ランキング","url":"/ranking/happoshu-consumption-expenditure"},{"label":"清酒の支出額の定義・ランキング","url":"/ranking/sake-consumption-expenditure"},{"label":"ワインの支出額の定義・ランキング","url":"/ranking/wine-consumption-expenditure"},{"label":"焼酎の支出額の定義・ランキング","url":"/ranking/shochu-consumption-expenditure"}]},"sourceName":"総務省 家計調査","sourceLink":"https://www.stat.go.jp/data/kakei/","rankingLink":"/ranking/beer-consumption-expenditure","gridColumnSpan":12,"gridColumnSpanTablet":null,"gridColumnSpanSm":null,"dataSource":"ranking","section":"drinks","sortOrder":20},{"componentKey":"md-household-food-spending-faq","componentType":"markdown-section","title":"よくある質問","description":null,"componentProps":{"displayMode":"faq","items":[{"question":"この数値は都道府県全体の値ですか？","answer":"都道府県庁所在市（東京都は特別区部）の二人以上世帯が調査対象です。県全体の平均ではないため、市と県の暮らしの違いは反映されません。"},{"question":"支出額と消費量はどう違いますか？","answer":"支出額は購入にかけた金額（円）、消費量は購入した数量（重さや容量）です。価格の高い品目を買うと、量が同じでも支出額は大きくなります。"},{"question":"調査世帯が少ないので数値が動きやすいのでは？","answer":"都市ごとの調査世帯数は多くないため、特に品目別の値は年によって動きます。1年の順位だけで結論を出さず、推移とあわせて読んでください。"}]},"sourceName":"総務省 家計調査","sourceLink":"https://www.stat.go.jp/data/kakei/","rankingLink":null,"gridColumnSpan":12,"gridColumnSpanTablet":null,"gridColumnSpanSm":null,"dataSource":"ranking","section":"reading","sortOrder":90}]